        {
            "id": "node_3",
            "name": "read_info_packages",
            "kind": "Processor",
            "parentId": "root",
            "children": [],
            "incomingLinks": [
                "link_14",
                "link_2890d0f2-b500-4390-a8b1-350ae9f1396e",
                "link_5bc8a287-c074-4ab0-9088-7d94de80bd6e"
            ],
            "outgoingLinks": [
                "link_19",
                "link_89bc0a9e-04c3-4100-8267-0be2f650db9f"
            ],
            "layout": {
                "x": 1171.0,
                "y": 1586.0,
                "width": 276.0,
                "height": 168.0,
                "closedWidth": 276.0,
                "closedHeight": 168.0,
                "openWidth": 276.0,
                "openHeight": 168.0,
                "isExpanded": true
            },
            "fileLayoutStrategyId": "none",
            "text": {
                "initialization": "",
                "initializationLanguageId": "",
                "source": "const connection = msExchangeClient.connect(config.exchange_url,config.exchange_user,config.exchange_password,config.exchange_account)\nfor(email of connection.read()){\n    for( attachment of msEschangeClient.getAttachments(email)){\n        raw_ip.push( new InfoPackage(id,attachment.content) )\n    }\n}\n\ninfoPackageError.length\n\nwfCompile.getSource(parameters)\n\nmsExchangeClient.read()\n\nvar iip=new InfoPackage()\n\n\n",
                "sourceLanguageId": "",
                "specification": "using the credentials provided in the configuration it connects to the api endpoint specified under\nexchange.* it connects to ms exchange and downloads all the csv attachments in the emails from the folder Inbox/PRC/TODO\nputs them in the local folder  todo\nthen it opens each file transforms it into a list of `InfoPackage` where the package payload is the row\nand pushes each of the packages to raw_ip\nmalformed rows will be pushed to info_package_error\n\n\n## Purpose\n\nRetrieve CSV attachments from a configured Microsoft Exchange mailbox, convert each CSV row into an `InfoPackage`, and route successfully parsed packages and malformed rows to their respective outputs.\n\n## Behavior\n\n1. Receive a `ModuleConfiguration` through the `config` input.\n\n2. Use the Exchange connection settings from the configuration:\n\n   * `exchange_url`\n   * `exchange_user`\n   * `exchange_account`\n   * `exchange_password`\n\n3. Connect to Microsoft Exchange using `ms_exchange_client`.\n\n4. Access the mailbox folder:\n\n   ```text\n   Inbox/PRC/TODO\n   ```\n\n5. Retrieve the emails in that folder and download every CSV attachment.\n\n6. Store the downloaded CSV files in the local folder:\n\n   ```text\n   todo\n   ```\n\n7. Process every downloaded CSV file.\n\n8. For each CSV data row:\n\n   * parse the row;\n   * create one `InfoPackage`;\n   * use the row contents as the package payload in `InfoPackage.package_info`;\n   * emit the resulting package through `raw_ip`.\n\n9. If a CSV row is malformed or cannot be transformed into a valid `InfoPackage`:\n\n   * do not emit it through `raw_ip`;\n   * create a `ProcessDataError` describing the failure;\n   * emit the error through `info_package_error`.\n\n10. Processing of a malformed row must not prevent subsequent rows or files from being processed.\n\nThe specification does not define how the remaining `InfoPackage` fields (`ID`, `date`, `valid`, `failed`, and `error`) are populated. Their values must therefore follow the project's existing `InfoPackage` conventions and must not be inferred from this component specification.\n\n## Constraints\n\n* Exchange credentials and endpoint information must come from the received `ModuleConfiguration`.\n* Only CSV attachments are downloaded for processing.\n* Attachments are retrieved from `Inbox/PRC/TODO`.\n* Downloaded CSV files are stored in the local `todo` folder before processing.\n* Each CSV data row is processed independently.\n* One successfully processed row produces one `InfoPackage`.\n* Malformed rows are routed to `info_package_error` and must not be routed to `raw_ip`.\n* A malformed row must not terminate processing of the remaining rows or files.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* Given valid Exchange configuration, the component can connect to the configured Microsoft Exchange account.\n* The component reads messages from `Inbox/PRC/TODO`.\n* Every CSV attachment found in the selected messages is downloaded to the local `todo` folder.\n* Every successfully parsed CSV data row results in exactly one `InfoPackage` emitted through `raw_ip`.\n* The CSV row is represented in the emitted package's `package_info`.\n* A malformed or unprocessable row produces a `ProcessDataError` through `info_package_error`.\n* A malformed row does not produce an `InfoPackage` through `raw_ip`.\n* Processing continues after an individual malformed row.\n* The output types and link contracts remain compatible with `remove_duplicates` and `error_handler`.\n",
                "specificationLanguageId": "markdown",
                "tests": "{\n  \"component\": \"/TestProject/read_info_packages\",\n  \"language\": \"json\",\n  \"tests\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"process_single_csv_attachment\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"config\": {\n          \"file_path\": \"./todo\",\n          \"frequency\": \"PT5M\",\n          \"jdbc_url\": \"jdbc:oracle:thin:@localhost:1521/FREEPDB1\",\n          \"jdbc_password\": \"test_password\",\n          \"jdbc_user\": \"test_user\",\n          \"exchange_user\": \"svc_prc\",\n          \"exchange_url\": \"[https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx](https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx)\",\n          \"exchange_account\": \"[prc@example.test](mailto:prc@example.test)\",\n          \"exchange_password\": \"exchange_test_password\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"mocks\": {\n        \"ms_exchange_client\": {\n          \"expected_connection\": {\n            \"url\": \"[https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx](https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx)\",\n            \"user\": \"svc_prc\",\n            \"account\": \"[prc@example.test](mailto:prc@example.test)\",\n            \"password\": \"exchange_test_password\"\n          },\n          \"expected_folder\": \"Inbox/PRC/TODO\",\n          \"emails\": [\n            {\n              \"subject\": \"PRC import\",\n              \"attachments\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"packages.csv\",\n                  \"content_type\": \"text/csv\",\n                  \"content\": \"ID,NAME,VALUE\\n1001,Alpha,42\\n1002,Beta,84\\n\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"expected_files\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"todo/packages.csv\",\n          \"exists\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"expected_outputs\": {\n        \"raw_ip\": [\n          {\n            \"package_info\": \"1001,Alpha,42\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"package_info\": \"1002,Beta,84\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"info_package_error\": []\n      },\n      \"assertions\": {\n        \"raw_ip_count\": 2,\n        \"info_package_error_count\": 0,\n        \"ignore_unspecified_InfoPackage_fields\": [\n          \"ID\",\n          \"date\",\n          \"valid\",\n          \"failed\",\n          \"error\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"process_multiple_csv_attachments_and_ignore_non_csv\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"config\": {\n          \"file_path\": \"./todo\",\n          \"frequency\": \"PT5M\",\n          \"jdbc_url\": \"jdbc:oracle:thin:@localhost:1521/FREEPDB1\",\n          \"jdbc_password\": \"test_password\",\n          \"jdbc_user\": \"test_user\",\n          \"exchange_user\": \"svc_prc\",\n          \"exchange_url\": \"[https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx](https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx)\",\n          \"exchange_account\": \"[prc@example.test](mailto:prc@example.test)\",\n          \"exchange_password\": \"exchange_test_password\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"mocks\": {\n        \"ms_exchange_client\": {\n          \"expected_folder\": \"Inbox/PRC/TODO\",\n          \"emails\": [\n            {\n              \"subject\": \"Batch A\",\n              \"attachments\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"batch_a.csv\",\n                  \"content_type\": \"text/csv\",\n                  \"content\": \"ID,NAME,VALUE\\n2001,Gamma,10\\n2002,Delta,20\\n\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"instructions.txt\",\n                  \"content_type\": \"text/plain\",\n                  \"content\": \"This attachment must not be processed.\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"subject\": \"Batch B\",\n              \"attachments\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"batch_b.csv\",\n                  \"content_type\": \"text/csv\",\n                  \"content\": \"ID,NAME,VALUE\\n2003,Epsilon,30\\n\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"expected_files\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"todo/batch_a.csv\",\n          \"exists\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"todo/batch_b.csv\",\n          \"exists\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"todo/instructions.txt\",\n          \"exists\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"expected_outputs\": {\n        \"raw_ip\": [\n          {\n            \"package_info\": \"2001,Gamma,10\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"package_info\": \"2002,Delta,20\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"package_info\": \"2003,Epsilon,30\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"info_package_error\": []\n      },\n      \"assertions\": {\n        \"raw_ip_count\": 3,\n        \"info_package_error_count\": 0,\n        \"csv_attachments_downloaded\": 2,\n        \"non_csv_attachments_downloaded\": 0,\n        \"ignore_unspecified_InfoPackage_fields\": [\n          \"ID\",\n          \"date\",\n          \"valid\",\n          \"failed\",\n          \"error\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"route_malformed_row_to_error_and_continue\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"config\": {\n          \"file_path\": \"./todo\",\n          \"frequency\": \"PT5M\",\n          \"jdbc_url\": \"jdbc:oracle:thin:@localhost:1521/FREEPDB1\",\n          \"jdbc_password\": \"test_password\",\n          \"jdbc_user\": \"test_user\",\n          \"exchange_user\": \"svc_prc\",\n          \"exchange_url\": \"[https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx](https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx)\",\n          \"exchange_account\": \"[prc@example.test](mailto:prc@example.test)\",\n          \"exchange_password\": \"exchange_test_password\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"mocks\": {\n        \"ms_exchange_client\": {\n          \"expected_folder\": \"Inbox/PRC/TODO\",\n          \"emails\": [\n            {\n              \"subject\": \"Mixed batch\",\n              \"attachments\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"mixed.csv\",\n                  \"content_type\": \"text/csv\",\n                  \"content\": \"ID,NAME,VALUE\\n3001,Zeta,11\\n\"3002,Eta,broken\\n3003,Theta,33\\n\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"expected_outputs\": {\n        \"raw_ip\": [\n          {\n            \"package_info\": \"3001,Zeta,11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"package_info\": \"3003,Theta,33\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"info_package_error\": [\n          {\n            \"error\": {\n              \"matches\": \"non-empty\"\n            },\n            \"package\": {\n              \"package_info\": {\n                \"matches\": \"contains:3002\"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"assertions\": {\n        \"raw_ip_count\": 2,\n        \"info_package_error_count\": 1,\n        \"malformed_row_not_emitted_to_raw_ip\": true,\n        \"processing_continues_after_malformed_row\": true,\n        \"ignore_unspecified_InfoPackage_fields\": [\n          \"ID\",\n          \"date\",\n          \"valid\",\n          \"failed\",\n          \"error\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"empty_csv_produces_no_packages\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"config\": {\n          \"file_path\": \"./todo\",\n          \"frequency\": \"PT5M\",\n          \"jdbc_url\": \"jdbc:oracle:thin:@localhost:1521/FREEPDB1\",\n          \"jdbc_password\": \"test_password\",\n          \"jdbc_user\": \"test_user\",\n          \"exchange_user\": \"svc_prc\",\n          \"exchange_url\": \"[https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx](https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx)\",\n          \"exchange_account\": \"[prc@example.test](mailto:prc@example.test)\",\n          \"exchange_password\": \"exchange_test_password\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"mocks\": {\n        \"ms_exchange_client\": {\n          \"expected_folder\": \"Inbox/PRC/TODO\",\n          \"emails\": [\n            {\n              \"subject\": \"Empty batch\",\n              \"attachments\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"empty.csv\",\n                  \"content_type\": \"text/csv\",\n                  \"content\": \"ID,NAME,VALUE\\n\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"expected_files\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"todo/empty.csv\",\n          \"exists\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"expected_outputs\": {\n        \"raw_ip\": [],\n        \"info_package_error\": []\n      },\n      \"assertions\": {\n        \"raw_ip_count\": 0,\n        \"info_package_error_count\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"no_matching_email_attachments\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"config\": {\n          \"file_path\": \"./todo\",\n          \"frequency\": \"PT5M\",\n          \"jdbc_url\": \"jdbc:oracle:thin:@localhost:1521/FREEPDB1\",\n          \"jdbc_password\": \"test_password\",\n          \"jdbc_user\": \"test_user\",\n          \"exchange_user\": \"svc_prc\",\n          \"exchange_url\": \"[https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx](https://exchange.example.test/EWS/Exchange.asmx)\",\n          \"exchange_account\": \"[prc@example.test](mailto:prc@example.test)\",\n          \"exchange_password\": \"exchange_test_password\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"mocks\": {\n        \"ms_exchange_client\": {\n          \"expected_folder\": \"Inbox/PRC/TODO\",\n          \"emails\": []\n        }\n      },\n      \"expected_outputs\": {\n        \"raw_ip\": [],\n        \"info_package_error\": []\n      },\n      \"assertions\": {\n        \"raw_ip_count\": 0,\n        \"info_package_error_count\": 0,\n        \"downloaded_csv_count\": 0\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
                "testsLanguageId": "json",
                "aiInstructions": "",
                "aiInstructionsLanguageId": "markdown"
            },
